<node id="项目问答技能">
  <data key="d0">项目问答技能</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">项目问答技能is a skill designed to provide intelligent Q&amp;A services for training projects, helping learners quickly resolve issues related to project rules, progress, and more.&lt;SEP&gt;项目问答技能是需要遵循智能体配置的敏感信息和标注规则的系统功能。</data>
